Date: Sun, 15 Nov 2026 17:30:32 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] drm/panel-edp: Add Sharp LQ150P1JX61 (Surface Laptop 7 15")

The Microsoft Surface Laptop 7 15" has a Sharp LQ150P1JX61 panel
(SHP 0x1577, 2496x1664 at 120 Hz) that is not in the table, so
panel-edp warns at every boot and falls back to conservative timings:

  Unknown panel SHP 0x1577, using conservative timings

Add it with the delays of the LQ138P1JX61 (0x1572), the 13.8-inch
panel of the same family used in the Surface Laptop 8.

edid-decode (hex):

00 ff ff ff ff ff ff 00 4d 10 77 15 a1 11 00 22
24 20 01 04 b5 20 15 78 03 7d 77 ad 50 46 ad 26
0f 50 53 00 00 00 01 01 01 01 01 01 01 01 01 01
01 01 01 01 01 01 25 d5 c0 a0 90 80 30 60 30 20
3a 00 3d d3 10 00 00 18 25 d5 c0 a0 90 80 e0 66
30 20 3a 00 3d d3 10 00 00 18 00 00 00 fd 00 18
78 ce ce 37 01 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 fc
00 4c 51 31 35 30 50 31 4a 58 36 31 0a 20 01 5c

02 03 0f 00 e3 05 80 00 e6 06 05 01 73 6a 0b 00
00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00
00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00
00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00
00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00
00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00
00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00
00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 aa

Tested on that laptop: the panel is detected by name, lights at the disk
unlock prompt and in the desktop, and comes back after two suspend and
resume cycles.

Assisted-by: Claude Fable 5.2
Signed-off-by: Felipe Infante de Castro <18445184+fidecastro@users.noreply.github.com>
---
 drivers/gpu/drm/panel/panel-edp.c | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/drivers/gpu/drm/panel/panel-edp.c b/drivers/gpu/drm/panel/panel-edp.c
index ce70e97..a7213f9 100644
--- a/drivers/gpu/drm/panel/panel-edp.c
+++ b/drivers/gpu/drm/panel/panel-edp.c
@@ -2196,6 +2196,7 @@ static const struct edp_panel_entry edp_panels[] = {
 	EDP_PANEL_ENTRY('S', 'H', 'P', 0x153a, &delay_200_500_e50, "LQ140T1JH01"),
 	EDP_PANEL_ENTRY('S', 'H', 'P', 0x154c, &delay_200_500_p2e100, "LQ116M1JW10"),
 	EDP_PANEL_ENTRY('S', 'H', 'P', 0x1572, &delay_200_500_e200, "LQ138P1JX61"),
+	EDP_PANEL_ENTRY('S', 'H', 'P', 0x1577, &delay_200_500_e200, "LQ150P1JX61"),
 	EDP_PANEL_ENTRY('S', 'H', 'P', 0x158f, &delay_200_500_p2e100, "LQ134Z1"),
 	EDP_PANEL_ENTRY('S', 'H', 'P', 0x1593, &delay_200_500_p2e100, "LQ134N1"),
 	EDP_PANEL_ENTRY('S', 'H', 'P', 0x15a7, &delay_200_500_e200, "LQ120P1JX51"),
